  "description": "Former judo star Joo Ha-Na marries her friend, Do Woo-Ri, and stages an insurance fraud so they can leave the country as a rich couple. Everything goes according to plan, including Woo-Ri's disappearance, and Ha-Na finally receives the money five years later. But when she goes to meet her husband, she comes face to face with his corpse instead. As Ha-Na tries to figure out what's happening, she gets a letter... from her dead man. With this new clue, can she unravel the mystery of his death?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes Prologue.*",
